---
// ForWriters.astro
---

<section id="creators" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#F4EFEB]/60 dark:bg-[#16111F] border-y border-arcanium-border/80 dark:border-arcanium-dark-border/80 relative transition-colors duration-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Copy & Value Proposition -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-arcanium-purple-subtle dark:bg-purple-950/50 text-arcanium-purple dark:text-arcanium-purple-light text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          Verified Writer Pipeline
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-arcanium-plum dark:text-arcanium-dark-text leading-tight">
          Where Authors & Readers Meet Directly.
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-arcanium-muted dark:text-arcanium-dark-muted leading-relaxed">
          Self-publish your serialized web novels, light novels, and graphic stories. Connect directly with an engaged audience without predatory platform contracts or algorithmic black boxes.
        </p>

        <!-- Writer Features List -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
          
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-arcanium-dark-card border border-arcanium-border dark:border-arcanium-dark-border flex items-center justify-center text-arcanium-purple dark:text-arcanium-purple-light flex-shrink-0 shadow-xs">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 20h9"/>
                <path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-arcanium-plum dark:text-arcanium-dark-text">Serialized Chapter Scheduling</h4>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-arcanium-muted dark:text-arcanium-dark-muted mt-0.5">
                Draft, format, and schedule releases with markdown support, footnotes, and custom illustration slots.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-arcanium-dark-card border border-arcanium-border dark:border-arcanium-dark-border flex items-center justify-center text-arcanium-amber dark:text-amber-400 flex-shrink-0 shadow-xs">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-arcanium-plum dark:text-arcanium-dark-text">Inline Reader Discussions & Reactions</h4>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-arcanium-muted dark:text-arcanium-dark-muted mt-0.5">
                Readers can leave margin notes, paragraph reactions, and theory threads that respect spoiler tags.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-arcanium-dark-card border border-arcanium-border dark:border-arcanium-dark-border flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 shadow-xs">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/>
                <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-arcanium-plum dark:text-arcanium-dark-text">Fair Direct Patronage (Keep 92%)</h4>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-arcanium-muted dark:text-arcanium-dark-muted mt-0.5">
                Enable reader tips, early-access chapters, and subscriptions. We take only an 8% operating fee.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 flex items-center gap-4">
          <a 
            href="#community" 
            class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold"
          >
            <span>Apply for Writer Early Access</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <span class="text-xs text-arcanium-muted dark:text-arcanium-dark-muted">No exclusivity lock-in.</span>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Writer Studio Mockup Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-arcanium-dark-card rounded-3xl border border-arcanium-border dark:border-arcanium-dark-border shadow-xl dark:shadow-dark-card p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 relative overflow-hidden">
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-arcanium-border dark:border-arcanium-dark-border">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-arcanium-plum dark:bg-arcanium-purple text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
                WS
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-arcanium-plum dark:text-arcanium-dark-text">Writer Studio Dashboard</h4>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-arcanium-muted dark:text-arcanium-dark-muted">Story: "Echoes of the High Spire"</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/50 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 dark:bg-emerald-400"></span>
              Published
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Writer Analytics Row -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
            <div class="bg-[#FAF8F5] dark:bg-arcanium-dark-surface p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-arcanium-border dark:border-arcanium-dark-border text-center">
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-arcanium-muted dark:text-arcanium-dark-muted block">Active Readers</span>
              <span class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-arcanium-plum dark:text-arcanium-dark-text">14,280</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold block mt-0.5">+18% this week</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#FAF8F5] dark:bg-arcanium-dark-surface p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-arcanium-border dark:border-arcanium-dark-border text-center">
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-arcanium-muted dark:text-arcanium-dark-muted block">Completion Rate</span>
              <span class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-arcanium-plum dark:text-arcanium-dark-text">87.4%</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-arcanium-purple dark:text-arcanium-purple-light font-semibold block mt-0.5">Top 5% tier</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#FAF8F5] dark:bg-arcanium-dark-surface p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-arcanium-border dark:border-arcanium-dark-border text-center">
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-arcanium-muted dark:text-arcanium-dark-muted block">Direct Tips</span>
              <span class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-arcanium-amber dark:text-amber-400">$1,420</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-arcanium-muted dark:text-arcanium-dark-muted block mt-0.5">32 patrons</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Reader Engagement Quote -->
          <div class="bg-arcanium-purple-subtle/50 dark:bg-purple-950/30 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-arcanium-purple/20 dark:border-purple-900/40 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-arcanium-purple dark:text-arcanium-purple-light uppercase">Latest Chapter Note (Ch. 28)</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-arcanium-muted dark:text-arcanium-dark-muted">12 min ago</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs italic text-arcanium-text/90 dark:text-arcanium-dark-text/90">
              "The twist at paragraph 14 took my breath away. Reading this on Arcanium with the ambient rain sound made it unforgettable."
            </p>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-arcanium-plum dark:text-arcanium-dark-text flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>— Reader @solitary_moth</span>
              <span class="text-amber-500">★★★★★</span>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
